Round-3 codex gpt-5.6-sol attempt on r11l: 8 live L5 attempts, no win.
Confirms and sharpens round-2's L5 sketch: the black/yellow diamond on a
handle is the SELECTED-state rendering (not a special handle), a click in
a different handle diamond silently switches carrier control, cargo/socket
contact is alignment-sensitive, several dotted glyphs are decoys. Recovered
a deterministic 60-click candidate that exhausts the L5 meter without
advancing frame.levels_completed past 4. Honest null (reproduction_verified
correctly reported false by the source agent) -- no registry count change,
frontier stays at level 4/reproducible_total_levels unaffected.

